 * Comprehensive ISO-3166 country dataset used by the application form.
 *
 * Bundled locally (rather than fetched from a runtime API) so the form works
 * offline, has no network latency on a static list, and never breaks if a
 * third-party countries API is rate-limited or down. Each entry carries the
